Yeah! She's definitely alive! 
She's part of SAT, the Special Assault Team!

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:09.910
Anyway, gimme your phone!

00:04:10.030 --> 00:04:11.400
Uh... okay?

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:21.970
Let's see... Here's 1... Here's 2... Here's 3...

00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:21.880
Want one of us to do it?

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:25.050
Don't bug me or I'll mess up!

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:30.650
Hello?

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:32.830
Rika!

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:35.960
Awesome! You're alive!

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:37.690
Isn't that nice, Sensei?

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:39.030
Takashi...

00:04:38.150 --> 00:04:40.260
{shizuka/bg}I was so worried!

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:40.570
Yeah, now...

00:04:42.490 --> 00:04:46.130
I had a lot of trouble, but...

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:49.710
Save that for later. 
Where are you right now? My place?

00:04:50.150 --> 00:04:51.890
Oh, no. It's not safe there anymore.

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:54.820
Uhm, we borrowed your guns and some other stuff...

00:04:54.820 --> 00:04:56.690
That's fine, but where are—

00:05:20.450 --> 00:05:22.920
Hello? Rika?

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:24.700
What's going on?

00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:26.220
This light...

00:05:27.150 --> 00:05:27.670
Impossible...

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:31.640
Miyamoto, try aiming your dot sight.

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:33.560
Huh? Why?

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:37.210
Just do it. Your gun uses an IC.

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:42.110
Well? Do you see the dot?

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:45.360
Uh... I don't.

00:05:46.390 --> 00:05:47.100
So it was...

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:49.320
Hey, Takagi. What's up?

00:05:53.130 --> 00:05:55.600
Hey, what're you doing? Hurry it up!

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:57.500
But the engine...

00:05:58.580 --> 00:05:59.200
What is it?

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:02.190
We lost power and now all of the computers are dead!

00:06:03.440 --> 00:06:08.270
Someone! Please help! My husband's pacemaker seems to have stopped!{"broken" to "stopped" -A0}

00:06:12.630 --> 00:06:14.850
Why is the engine stalling right now...

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:16.390
Don't screw with me!

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:17.720
Sensei! Up front!

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:37.050
What the...

00:06:41.950 --> 00:06:42.440
Hey...

00:06:43.900 --> 00:06:44.600
This is bad...

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:48.770
My phone's dead. We need to stand guard!

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:51.810
Hell no!

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:55.000
Hey, don't run! What kind of man are you?!

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:58.020
Shit!

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:00.690
Electromagnetic pulse?

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:02.500
An EMP attack.

00:07:03.350 --> 00:07:06.180
Also known as HANE. 
High-altitude nuclear explosion.

00:07:06.880 --> 00:07:09.850
When a nuclear warhead explodes in the upper atmosphere,

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:12.860
the gamma rays make electrons 
get repelled from atmospheric particles

00:07:13.100 --> 00:07:14.450
which causes the Compton effect.

00:07:14.860 --> 00:07:17.730
The flying electrons get caught in Earth's electromagnetic field

00:07:18.140 --> 00:07:21.090
and emit an electromagnetic pulse over a wide range.

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:24.490
That effect is lethal to electronics.

00:07:25.310 --> 00:07:30.060
The electromagnetic pulse gets transmitted 
through antennas and fries integrated circuits.

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:33.100
So basically, right now...

00:07:33.360 --> 00:07:35.870
We can't use electronics!

00:07:36.670 --> 00:07:38.740
So we can't use cell phones?

00:07:39.840 --> 00:07:42.160
Not just phones, but computers too.

00:07:42.510 --> 00:07:47.020
Cars won't work either. 
The power plants are probably dead too.

00:07:44.200 --> 00:07:45.440
{alice/bg}There there.

00:07:47.790 --> 00:07:53.640
EMP counter-measures have been taken, but only for the SDF and a small part of the government.

00:08:00.020 --> 00:08:01.750
Is there a way to fix this?

00:08:02.350 --> 00:08:03.130
Papa?{"Dad" -A0}

00:08:06.190 --> 00:08:09.320
The cars might be able to work if you change the fried parts.

00:08:10.140 --> 00:08:14.760
There might be some cars that still work because electromagnetic waves have little effect on them...

00:08:16.030 --> 00:08:18.320
Of course, classic cars should still work.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:19.950
Go check immediately.

00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:20.790
Yes!

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:22.080
SAYA!

00:08:22.880 --> 00:08:23.370
Huh?

00:08:24.240 --> 00:08:29.150
You have done well to keep your head on during this chaos! That is admirable!

00:08:32.310 --> 00:08:32.660
Pa—{"Da—" -A0}

