00:12:50.530 --> 00:12:51.590
There's no end to this...

00:12:51.890 --> 00:12:52.840
No kidding.

00:12:53.490 --> 00:12:55.570
The longer this gets dragged on, the worse it gets.

00:12:55.940 --> 00:12:57.280
We don't have enough bullets, either!

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:20.350
Commander, I checked from the 2nd floor.

00:13:21.030 --> 00:13:24.110
The people we deployed to the
neighboring area have yet to be attacked.

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:26.360
We may be able to retake the gate.{"They might be able to reinforce the door."Huh? What door? Line was taken from manga -A0}

