00:13:36.240 --> 00:13:39.320
Men who have the will to fight, assemble!

00:13:39.910 --> 00:13:43.870
Women and children who wish to live, gather in back!

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:44.580
Darling...

00:13:44.850 --> 00:13:47.120
Papa, if we barricade ourselves in the house—

00:13:47.190 --> 00:13:48.810
There is no meaning in protecting the house!

00:13:49.290 --> 00:13:51.470
