00:13:52.490 --> 00:13:56.140
Even if we stay in the house, they will just force their way in and we will be eaten!

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:02.280
You have your filial piety,
 do you not, Komuro-kun?!

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:07.610
Falter not. Embark upon your own path!

00:14:08.290 --> 00:14:08.670
Yes.

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:11.030
Hirano-kun.

00:14:13.110 --> 00:14:15.680
I am entrusting my daughter to you.{"My daughter is yours for safe keeping." -A0}

00:14:16.570 --> 00:14:19.140
Papa! What the hell is that supposed to mean?!{"Dad, The hell" -A0}

00:14:22.870 --> 00:14:23.770
Mama?

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:29.200
Souichiro-san and I have a duty to perform, Saya-chan.

00:14:30.230 --> 00:14:35.300
It's our selfish desire as your parents to leave you
 in Hirano-kun and Komuro-kun's hands.

00:14:36.420 --> 00:14:39.310
And the guilt we feel about this isn't something we'll forget.

00:14:40.420 --> 00:14:42.690
Please, don't make this harder than it already is.

00:14:43.910 --> 00:14:44.900
Mama...

00:14:46.720 --> 00:14:47.740
Auntie?

00:14:49.870 --> 00:14:50.580
You're a good girl.

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:53.440
My daughter is a good girl too!

00:14:57.010 --> 00:15:00.080
Listen to what your elder "siblings" tell you, okay?

00:15:05.220 --> 00:15:05.670
Now...

00:15:09.770 --> 00:15:10.750
Go!

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:13.200
Papa!

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:14.650
Mama!

00:15:16.210 --> 00:15:17.300
I love you!

00:15:22.150 --> 00:15:23.650
Throw the dynamite!

00:15:24.210 --> 00:15:25.500
Okay!

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:40.940
Mato-san! {W.E. note to anyone doing BD-rips with this -- this name was "Maddo-san" in an earlier episode, and should be changed to be consistent one way or the other.}{To "Mato" to match Ep.10 -A0}

00:15:44.640 --> 00:15:45.410
He's not here?

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:47.370
Ojou-sama!

00:15:48.970 --> 00:15:50.590
Don't just pop out of somewhere!

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:52.360
You're in luck, Ojou-sama.

00:15:52.690 --> 00:15:55.080
This was built to withstand EMP attacks!

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:58.530
And it's got triple copper plating!

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:01.200
Owner must be a damn maniac!

00:16:01.900 --> 00:16:04.290
So this car works?

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:07.730
Yeah, but I need some time to repair the damage.

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:12.970
Then all we can do is wait here, correct?

00:16:19.970 --> 00:16:20.830
Incoming!

00:16:33.600 --> 00:16:34.750
Souichiro-san.

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:37.380
If this keeps up, it'll be a stalemate.

00:16:38.670 --> 00:16:39.530
Yuriko.

00:16:40.420 --> 00:16:41.200
You are...

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:43.200
A fine woman!{"One" to "A" -A0}

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:46.210
Now let's go!

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:02.200
Sensei! {W.E.: And even the loli proves herself more useful than Nia, I mean, Shizuka.}

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:04.930
Good job!

00:17:09.770 --> 00:17:11.320
Woooow!

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:12.500
Why're you dazing off?

00:17:12.830 --> 00:17:14.820
That's how the author wrote me...{lit: im that kind of character}

00:17:14.820 --> 00:17:16.400
Yeah okay! Get in the car!

00:17:17.630 --> 00:17:18.510
Okay!

00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:23.240
This is our Alamo!

00:17:23.240 --> 00:17:24.740
Didn't the Alamo fall?

00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:25.480
Don't wanna hear it!

00:17:35.680 --> 00:17:36.440
Rei!

00:17:41.690 --> 00:17:42.490
You okay?

00:17:43.960 --> 00:17:44.710
Let's go!

00:17:45.010 --> 00:17:46.300
Oh, yeah!

00:17:48.340 --> 00:17:51.840
Too bad I can't have a little more play time with this sucker...

00:17:52.520 --> 00:17:53.140
You're good to go!

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:54.530
Thanks!

00:17:57.970 --> 00:17:59.360
It's moving!

00:18:00.040 --> 00:18:01.390
Guys! Come back!

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:07.920
Get on, Mato-san!{ -A0}

00:18:10.390 --> 00:18:14.060
The woman of my dreams is with you guys.{Rather vague (as is, he loves Saya, why not go w/ them) & doesn't match manga but didn't change it -A0}

00:18:17.060 --> 00:18:20.200
Stay alive, Saya-ojousama!

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:25.450
Here we go!

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:31.310
Now then...

00:18:31.660 --> 00:18:32.940
It's show time!

00:18:55.470 --> 00:18:56.580
How we're getting out of here?

00:18:56.960 --> 00:18:58.510
Our only option is over there.

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:02.590
Huh? That's too narrow!

00:19:04.810 --> 00:19:05.850
Keep it up!

00:19:14.130 --> 00:19:15.000
Saeko!

00:19:25.530 --> 00:19:26.300
Have they left?

00:19:27.700 --> 00:19:32.660
Yes. Our daughter is with young friends who care about her.{"other loving young people" to "young friends who care about her" -A0}

00:19:35.960 --> 00:19:36.900
Now...

00:19:38.830 --> 00:19:40.570
I have nothing to worry about!

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:53.410
I think we'll be okay...

00:19:55.780 --> 00:19:57.600
Please just don't say anything.

00:19:58.670 --> 00:19:59.180
Please.

00:20:00.060 --> 00:20:00.970
Takagi-san!

00:20:01.290 --> 00:20:01.990
What?

00:20:02.440 --> 00:20:03.900
Keep it together!

00:20:04.320 --> 00:20:05.920
Hirano! You—

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:07.840
It's okay. Really.

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:09.990
Hirano is...

00:20:10.460 --> 00:20:11.760
Kouta is correct.

00:20:13.680 --> 00:20:16.290
Anyway, doesn't the engine sound weird?

00:20:16.800 --> 00:20:19.240
Well, this car is in bad shape.

00:20:19.640 --> 00:20:21.260
Where are we headed?

00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:22.570
As far as you can take us.

00:20:23.390 --> 00:20:27.260
Rei and I need you to help us look for our parents. Sorry.

00:20:28.340 --> 00:20:30.920
Afterwards, we'll look for your friend.

00:20:32.410 --> 00:20:33.180
Okay!

00:20:34.100 --> 00:20:35.520
We will be at the highway soon!

00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:52.740
So many...

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:00.480
Good grief.

00:21:11.810 --> 00:21:13.070
This is such...

00:21:19.060 --> 00:21:20.320
A pain in the ass!

